<title>USA: Bemis agrees to acquire  Paramount.</title>
<headline>Bemis agrees to acquire  Paramount.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bemis Co Inc said Thursday it has reached an agreement in principle to acquire  Paramount Packaging Corp. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to governmental approval and the execution of a definitive agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>Chalfont, Pennsylvania-based Paramount is a privately held manufacturer of flexible packaging products. It has annual sales of about $130 million.</p>
<p>Bemis also provides packaging materials and has annual sales of about $1.7 billion.</p>
<p>Bemis shares traded 3/8 higher at 35.</p>
<p>	  Reuters Chicago Newsdesk  312-408-8787</p>
